WEBVTT

00:00:12.820 --> 00:00:13.360
Destroy everything!

00:00:43.340 --> 00:00:44.930
What the hell? Tell me immediately!

00:00:45.410 --> 00:00:45.950
Yes, sir!

00:00:46.170 --> 00:00:48.250
He didn't see us.

00:00:48.620 --> 00:00:49.420
It's always the same.

00:00:49.700 --> 00:00:54.790
You two are ready to go. Poseidon can also fly with the autopilot.

00:00:55.010 --> 00:00:55.450
Quick!

00:00:55.920 --> 00:00:56.360
Good!

00:01:00.340 --> 00:01:00.540
GO!

00:01:01.820 --> 00:01:03.300
Renkei, how long have you been here?

00:01:04.140 --> 00:01:06.520
I'm a warrior, always alert! Let's go, let's go!

00:01:11.510 --> 00:01:11.630
Come on!

00:01:51.850 --> 00:01:53.250
There he is! Do you see him?

00:01:54.150 --> 00:01:54.930
Ready for the hook!

00:01:55.820 --> 00:01:56.040
That's it!

00:03:01.460 --> 00:03:02.740
...finished with the robot jet!

00:03:03.670 --> 00:03:05.090
Don't be so hasty, Marshal Hitler!

00:03:05.820 --> 00:03:06.640
Keep the germs.

00:03:19.290 --> 00:03:21.170
We can never be sure with the jet-robot.

00:03:22.580 --> 00:03:25.640
That's why I sent the demon Hago to shoot him with explosive eyes.

00:03:25.860 --> 00:03:28.900
Besides, I'm trying to find out what his secret strength is.

00:03:28.940 --> 00:03:29.960
Demon, head down!

00:03:30.350 --> 00:03:31.800
Yes, my Lord.

00:03:32.780 --> 00:03:35.680
Are you keeping him, Doxy?

00:03:36.380 --> 00:03:38.620
The jet robot was very well designed.

00:03:38.960 --> 00:03:41.820
But you must absolutely discover what the mechanisms are.

00:03:41.880 --> 00:03:43.580
Do you think you can make a silver head out of it?

00:03:43.880 --> 00:03:44.480
Yes, my Lord.

00:03:45.090 --> 00:03:48.690
The robot is perfect, but the pilots are human beings.

00:03:48.770 --> 00:03:51.390
You seem very confident about yourself.

00:03:52.050 --> 00:03:57.390
Once the Jet-Robo is destroyed, we'll master the Jet-Rage Collector in Sao Tome.

00:03:57.510 --> 00:03:59.630
Then conquering the Earth will be a...

00:04:00.000 --> 00:04:01.620
Yes, my lord.

00:04:02.220 --> 00:04:06.840
Fortunately, you have a particular skill in the art of transformation.

00:04:07.480 --> 00:04:08.860
In anything you want.

00:04:09.240 --> 00:04:14.640
You have the opportunity to show your abilities, silver-headed.

00:04:15.300 --> 00:04:16.860
Yes, great Brai, as you wish.

00:04:17.160 --> 00:04:19.530
Simon Brai!

00:04:19.570 --> 00:04:27.810
Hit the ball too hard, otherwise you lose out of the game.

00:04:28.190 --> 00:04:29.770
Well, then...

00:04:30.310 --> 00:04:31.450
Just one hand! Go on, shoot!

00:04:51.140 --> 00:04:53.800
I didn't do it on purpose, now I'm going to look for the ball.

00:04:53.960 --> 00:04:54.220
Okay!

00:04:54.700 --> 00:04:55.680
Subtitles by the Amara.org community

00:05:01.240 --> 00:05:02.260
Don't trample the flowers!

00:05:02.320 --> 00:05:10.190
Oh my God, she looks like a fairy!

00:05:10.720 --> 00:05:13.080
Please, you have to be gentle with the flowers.

00:05:13.380 --> 00:05:16.660
I'm sorry, little girl, I didn't mean to upset you.

00:05:16.720 --> 00:05:18.620
I was just looking for a ball.

00:05:19.170 --> 00:05:21.870
I understand. Is this the one by chance?

00:05:22.340 --> 00:05:23.420
Yes, that's the one.

00:05:23.640 --> 00:05:25.680
You don't know how lucky I am to have found it. Thank you.

00:05:26.480 --> 00:05:29.620
I don't want to return it to an individual who treats flowers badly.

00:05:30.060 --> 00:05:30.220
Very good!

00:05:31.620 --> 00:05:35.500
And I repeat, I didn't do it on purpose. I'll get out of here right now. Please, give it back to me.

00:05:37.930 --> 00:05:38.130
Hey!

00:05:38.950 --> 00:05:39.530
Where did she go?

00:05:43.020 --> 00:05:44.960
Little girl, please give me back my ball!

00:05:47.820 --> 00:05:48.120
Don't look at me!

00:06:02.910 --> 00:06:03.230
Leave me alone!

00:06:03.640 --> 00:06:12.180
What happened?

00:06:17.820 --> 00:06:20.010
And you, be careful next time!

00:06:20.150 --> 00:06:22.830
You want to play ball and you don't even know how to shoot the ball!

00:06:23.150 --> 00:06:24.330
Hey, calm down, Benkey!

00:06:24.490 --> 00:06:27.750
It was too hot for the exercises, so we decided to play.

00:06:28.460 --> 00:06:29.940
Put on your socks and ask...

00:06:30.000 --> 00:06:35.000
I told you to apologize, clear?

00:06:35.450 --> 00:06:37.170
But, Benkei, don't you see that she left?

00:06:38.030 --> 00:06:46.100
Why did she take so much?

00:06:46.200 --> 00:06:47.790
I don't know.

00:06:50.190 --> 00:06:51.610
Luckily you didn't do anything.

00:06:52.210 --> 00:06:54.970
Very kind.

00:06:55.410 --> 00:06:57.670
Sorry for what I told you before.

00:06:57.990 --> 00:06:59.490
Well, here, really...

00:07:00.000 --> 00:07:04.510
They played football and they were your friends, if I'm not mistaken.

00:07:04.860 --> 00:07:08.360
That's right, they are schoolmates, members of the Jetta team.

00:07:08.440 --> 00:07:10.450
I understand, but it's very strange.

00:07:11.520 --> 00:07:11.600
What?

00:07:12.010 --> 00:07:14.470
I was listening to their speeches.

00:07:15.280 --> 00:07:20.100
Those two were really talking badly about you.

00:07:20.220 --> 00:07:22.300
About me? And what were they saying?

00:07:22.480 --> 00:07:25.520
Well, they were saying, Benkei is definitely out of his mind.

00:07:27.120 --> 00:07:29.520
But guys, we often say...

00:07:30.000 --> 00:07:31.300
These things belong to our friends!

00:07:31.740 --> 00:07:36.000
In the meantime they spoke badly behind your back and you should absolutely not allow it!

00:07:36.140 --> 00:07:37.140
Don't pay attention to it!

00:07:38.290 --> 00:07:41.150
They didn't want to offend me, I'm sure!

00:07:41.770 --> 00:07:43.080
I hope you're right!

00:07:47.500 --> 00:07:58.000
I'm that stone inside the wheel!

00:08:00.000 --> 00:08:01.460
Did something go wrong?

00:08:03.140 --> 00:08:06.380
Be brave, Benkei, don't give up, keep training with your mother.

00:08:06.680 --> 00:08:10.660
Wait a moment, this stupid joke didn't make me laugh at all!

00:08:11.000 --> 00:08:14.340
What's wrong, Benkei? You're getting better with baseball, right?

00:08:14.480 --> 00:08:16.680
Yes, you two don't know anything!

00:08:16.880 --> 00:08:18.740
Hey, what's wrong with you, buddy?

00:08:19.100 --> 00:08:21.660
You're behaving strangely today, Benkei.

00:08:21.780 --> 00:08:27.350
But, uncle, if you have something against me, say it clear and clear, but don't take advantage of me, clear?

00:08:27.820 --> 00:08:29.960
Don't say nonsense, Benkei, we don't know...

00:08:30.000 --> 00:08:31.500
We absolutely don't know what you're talking about.

00:08:31.540 --> 00:08:33.480
Don't get so excited and explain yourself instead.

00:08:33.840 --> 00:08:37.000
Keep being so intelligent and do it, but be careful.

00:08:37.160 --> 00:08:38.460
It doesn't end here, you'll regret it!

00:08:38.800 --> 00:08:40.170
Dante, there's something wrong!

00:08:41.940 --> 00:08:42.600
Don't worry!

00:08:43.640 --> 00:08:45.640
Guys, dinner is ready, come!

00:08:50.370 --> 00:08:50.930
Good!

00:08:51.760 --> 00:08:56.470
The chicken, my favorite dish!

00:08:56.770 --> 00:08:58.330
I'm starving, let's start!

00:09:00.030 --> 00:09:07.260
You're kidding me!

00:09:07.420 --> 00:09:12.040
If you've decided to ruin my best moment, you've succeeded!

00:09:12.580 --> 00:09:14.420
Now get out of here and let's settle the costs!

00:09:14.720 --> 00:09:18.220
Professor Guller!

00:09:18.260 --> 00:09:19.080
Yes, my lord?

00:09:19.380 --> 00:09:21.720
Get ready to put the demon head in silver.

00:09:22.020 --> 00:09:23.360
There's not much time left.

00:09:23.580 --> 00:09:24.730
Yes, my lord?

00:10:00.000 --> 00:10:02.040
Otherwise I would have cut them in pieces!

00:10:02.260 --> 00:10:05.380
You're right, they shouldn't have behaved like that.

00:10:05.380 --> 00:10:07.000
I just can't understand them.

00:10:07.100 --> 00:10:09.080
You stopped just in time, Genki.

00:10:09.910 --> 00:10:12.590
I was about to hit him for real.

00:10:12.830 --> 00:10:15.850
I didn't think our friendship could end.

00:10:16.910 --> 00:10:20.510
But now I don't see why I should keep those two.

00:10:20.710 --> 00:10:23.280
You can't go, you'll ruin everything.

00:10:23.700 --> 00:10:28.590
The best way to solve things and fight with them is to do it.

00:10:28.750 --> 00:10:29.030
Right!

00:10:30.000 --> 00:10:35.670
There are moments when a man can't choose between compromises.

00:10:35.750 --> 00:10:37.600
Who knows if that's what they want?

00:10:37.840 --> 00:10:39.720
Thank you, Genki, I don't have to lose.

00:10:39.940 --> 00:10:42.220
I'll fight like a man, you can bet on it.

00:10:47.720 --> 00:10:52.000
I met him this morning while I was looking for the ball.

00:10:52.620 --> 00:10:57.770
It was you who told me about Hayato and Ryo and their plot against me.

00:11:17.760 --> 00:11:19.020
Why are you still awake, Hayato?

00:11:19.620 --> 00:11:22.890
Yeah, all this noise, you can't close your eyes.

00:11:23.090 --> 00:11:27.120
They say that those who have deep sleep have a calm conscience.

00:11:27.380 --> 00:11:28.520
But I don't think that's the case.

00:11:30.700 --> 00:11:36.660
I would be amazed if it was Jenki who made up the joke.

00:11:37.000 --> 00:11:37.460
What joke?

00:11:37.880 --> 00:11:40.040
Putting the frog under the broom.

00:11:40.710 --> 00:11:42.550
Megiru seemed to think so.

00:11:43.130 --> 00:11:43.650
Really?

00:11:44.690 --> 00:11:47.210
I don't think Jenki is capable of that.

00:11:47.570 --> 00:11:48.550
Neither am I, Ryo.

00:11:53.580 --> 00:11:57.260
Besides, I would like to find out who put that stone in the tire.

00:11:57.720 --> 00:11:58.920
It was a really...

00:11:59.270 --> 00:11:59.970
Anyway...

00:12:00.030 --> 00:12:01.550
There's nothing serious in all this.

00:12:01.810 --> 00:12:03.470
Well, let's try to sleep now.

00:12:03.690 --> 00:12:05.730
Ok, good night.

00:12:58.250 --> 00:12:59.390
that would serve our purpose.

00:13:00.000 --> 00:13:01.260
They would be able to teach others.

00:13:01.740 --> 00:13:04.860
Instead, we must make a way to crush the spirit of the body.

00:13:05.020 --> 00:13:06.740
Create enmity between them.

00:13:08.220 --> 00:13:11.300
Only in this way we will be able to master the robot jets.

00:13:15.690 --> 00:13:25.000
When they will not be able to find you, the confusion will increase.

00:13:25.100 --> 00:13:26.620
But I will leave you alive for now.

00:13:27.790 --> 00:13:29.970
You will be good, good for...

00:13:30.000 --> 00:13:33.800
12 hours! And when you wake up, the robot jet will be gone!

00:13:34.220 --> 00:13:36.020
Javelin, transmit the blocking rays!

00:13:47.140 --> 00:13:48.240
Are you serious, Benkei?

00:13:48.490 --> 00:13:48.650
Yes!

00:13:49.220 --> 00:13:52.540
Professor, I'm not joking, I don't want to work with these two anymore!

00:13:52.620 --> 00:13:53.640
Stop it, Denkei!

00:13:53.780 --> 00:13:56.720
Either you go or I'll go! There's no room for everyone here!

00:13:57.280 --> 00:13:59.600
Stop this nonsense! Come out!

00:14:00.060 --> 00:14:07.110
Calm down, kid. Benkei, tell me what's going on.

00:14:07.210 --> 00:14:11.860
You know very well, to make the robot jet work,

00:14:11.920 --> 00:14:15.740
you need three leg pilots, who intend themselves to perfection.

00:14:18.500 --> 00:14:20.160
We've been waiting for this for a long time.

00:14:20.240 --> 00:14:22.210
Silver vest, go!

00:14:45.580 --> 00:14:47.800
Get out of your head, we were the ones who made those jokes!

00:14:48.390 --> 00:14:50.490
I have the proof to confirm it, Rio.

00:14:50.650 --> 00:14:54.390
Someone heard you while you were planning and came to tell you.

00:14:54.550 --> 00:14:54.570
Eh?

00:14:55.660 --> 00:14:56.520
And who could it be?

00:14:56.720 --> 00:14:57.980
Professor, there's the mega demon!

00:14:58.320 --> 00:14:58.540
What?

00:14:59.400 --> 00:14:59.980
Directed by...

00:15:00.000 --> 00:15:01.900
Look at us, Professor. Look at the monitor.

00:15:03.130 --> 00:15:05.270
I'll show you the route he took. It's very fast.

00:15:09.270 --> 00:15:12.010
The mega-demon is approaching all the men and their places.

00:15:12.350 --> 00:15:13.630
Machines, get ready to leave!

00:15:17.690 --> 00:15:19.770
All the positive spies, two minutes to go.

00:15:20.840 --> 00:15:23.300
Professor, don't worry, I'll go alone with Ayato.

00:15:23.460 --> 00:15:27.540
Speak as if I were not there, Professor, I'll go too, but this is the last time!

00:15:27.680 --> 00:15:29.900
I beg you to provide my replacement, please!

00:15:30.000 --> 00:15:32.000
Make sure everything is set up when I come back!

00:15:32.300 --> 00:15:33.940
Let's go, Hayato! Come on!

00:15:55.080 --> 00:15:56.360
Don't panic. The doctor is coming.

00:16:00.570 --> 00:16:00.790
Do you feel me?

00:16:01.400 --> 00:16:02.540
Where is Bengay?

00:16:03.130 --> 00:16:03.470
They're in the lab.

00:16:03.970 --> 00:16:05.390
I absolutely must talk to them.

00:16:05.590 --> 00:16:06.450
No, Janky!

00:16:06.750 --> 00:16:07.290
Misiru, talk to them!

00:16:13.750 --> 00:16:14.390
The train is approaching!

00:16:15.840 --> 00:16:16.640
Mankey, where are you going?

00:16:17.430 --> 00:16:17.670
Let's go!

00:16:18.300 --> 00:16:21.300
You're done messing with me, now I'll do it with my own head!

00:16:21.460 --> 00:16:24.180
I'll show you how the mega-demon stops!

00:16:24.300 --> 00:16:24.960
Quick, information!

00:16:34.120 --> 00:16:35.200
I said I'll break your nose!

00:16:45.000 --> 00:16:48.120
You are no longer hooked, the robot jet has become an easy prey.

00:16:48.340 --> 00:16:50.120
Look at the end of your friends.

00:16:50.520 --> 00:16:57.050
With you, prisoners, they can no longer gather and attack.

00:16:57.680 --> 00:16:59.340
I will capture them one after the other.

00:17:02.140 --> 00:17:03.810
Don't let him get out!

00:17:05.450 --> 00:17:07.430
Hayato, let's try to hit him together!

00:17:07.710 --> 00:17:09.830
I'll go this way, you go to the left!

00:17:10.170 --> 00:17:11.400
Ok, I'm ready!

00:17:11.760 --> 00:17:15.350
Put them on him!

00:17:20.620 --> 00:17:23.570
Enki, pull the control lever!

00:17:26.680 --> 00:17:27.160
Hayato!

00:17:30.920 --> 00:17:32.100
What's going on, Mihiru?

00:17:32.940 --> 00:17:35.460
Junkie must talk to Benkey. It's terrible!

00:17:38.310 --> 00:17:38.510
Bye!

00:17:54.120 --> 00:17:54.240
Thank you.

00:17:54.790 --> 00:17:55.410
It was her!

00:17:55.940 --> 00:17:57.440
It came from the Empire of Demons!

00:17:57.930 --> 00:17:59.930
They used that innocent little girl!

00:18:00.000 --> 00:18:00.860
...to deceive me!

00:18:00.920 --> 00:18:03.020
Ryo, wait for me!

00:18:05.660 --> 00:18:06.900
Transmit the blocking rays!

00:18:08.820 --> 00:18:13.030
No! What's happening? I can't see!

00:18:13.500 --> 00:18:14.460
My eyes!

00:18:14.880 --> 00:18:17.380
Ryo, quick!

00:18:18.560 --> 00:18:20.820
Let's try to reunite with Jetta Poseidon!

00:18:21.040 --> 00:18:22.630
Push the automatic command ship!

00:18:23.430 --> 00:18:25.380
My body!

00:18:26.070 --> 00:18:27.470
I'm immobilized! Help!

00:18:27.770 --> 00:18:28.390
We have to try!

00:18:30.700 --> 00:18:31.680
Thank you.

00:18:31.910 --> 00:18:32.890
Thank you.

00:19:06.110 --> 00:19:06.740
It's time to surrender!

00:19:07.060 --> 00:19:09.060
S**t, transmit the blocking rays!

00:19:28.560 --> 00:19:29.100
S**t, it's beautiful!

00:19:32.460 --> 00:19:32.900
I love you!

00:20:06.680 --> 00:20:08.960
I cry because of your tears. Damn it!

00:20:09.520 --> 00:20:13.380
I cry for your friends. I hope they are in hell!

00:20:30.000 --> 00:20:33.580
Please Demonia, my friends, now everything is clear between us, isn't it?

00:20:35.460 --> 00:20:36.340
Sure, Benkei!

00:20:36.400 --> 00:20:36.760
I'm sorry!

00:20:39.180 --> 00:20:39.440
Bravo!

00:20:40.600 --> 00:20:41.420
Yes, Benkei!

00:20:41.560 --> 00:20:41.880
Bravo!

00:20:42.520 --> 00:20:43.600
You killed the demon!

00:20:44.840 --> 00:20:49.030
Well, Rio, Hayato, Benkei, return to base, there is a surprise.

00:20:49.490 --> 00:20:51.530
We have prepared a party for the victory!
